{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00962","headline":"横吹曲辞 入塞曲 · 耿[湋]","name":"横吹曲辞 入塞曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军带十围，重锦制戎衣。\n猨臂销弓力，虯须长劒威。\n首登平乐宴，新破大宛归。\n楼上姝姬笑，门前问客稀。\n暮烽玄菟急，秋草紫骝肥。\n未奉君主诏，高槐昼掩扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿[湋]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00962.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00962","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}